ight: normal; page-break-before: auto;\" align=\"left\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" size=\"2\">The contents update dynamically based on the current selection;</font></font></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"western\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; page-break-before: auto;\" align=\"left\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" size=\"2\">If no elements are selected but a tool is selected, the settings of that tool are displayed;</font></font></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"western\" style=\"page-break-before: auto;\" align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">E</span></span></font></font></font><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">diting immediately updates </span></span></font></font></font><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">either the </span></span></font></font></font><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">selected elements </span></span></font></font></font><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">or the active tool settings</span></span></font></font></font><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">;</span></span></font></font></font></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"w